data: {"id": "5b272e28b43a42c0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1392", "run_id": "5b272e28b43a42c0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的事实与冲突：\n\n1.  **Pod 身份与生命周期**：Pod `aiops-case-11/workload` UID 为 `00030ff2-85db-453a-808d-4293aba8f20c`，调度在 `node2`。`deletionTimestamp` 为 `2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`，但 `phase` 仍为 `Running`，存在 Terminating Stuck 迹象。\n2.  **Terminating Stuck 的直接原因（最终izers）**：YAML 显示 `finalizers: [aiops.lab/hold]`。这解释了为何 Pod 在发出删除请求后仍然处于 Terminating 状态（因为该 finalizer 未被清理）。\n3.  **容器状态异常**：容器 `app` 处于 `Error` 状态，`exitCode=137`（SIGKILL），状态为 `ContainersNotReady`。\n4.  **OOM 证据不足**：\n    *   **Metrics 空**：`execute_pod_promql` ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788475549279, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

